  "material": {
    "_comment": "Frosted glass. Impossible OS runs acrylic slightly frostier than Windows 11: a wider blur, a touch less tint, and a faint noise grain, so the wallpaper reads through as soft colour rather than shapes. blur is the box-blur radius passed to gfx_acrylic (three passes approximate a Gaussian of about 1.7x that radius); opacity values are 0-255.",
